      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILLOWS GIRL (6) was last seen when second in the Nutrien final four months ago and had won five of her previous six outings including the Gold Bracelet Final. Draws wide but owns a good fresh record and will be ready to go off a nice trial. SWEET IRISH LOCH (3) was good through the Vicbred series, coming from this barrier to win her semi-final at this circuit and distance before a fourth from wider in the final. Has the race fitness edge on the top pick. That could see her challenge. KEAYANG PASSION (5) placed in all three rounds of the Vicbred series including her third from back row in the final. Yet to miss a place at this distance. Can be in the finish again. TACTICALLY PERFECT NZ (2) is up in grade off her resuming win at Terang but draws lower. Won the only time she started here and is lightly raced with upside.",
